#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:22
msgid ""
"值中的整数使用小端序。SESSION 增加 14 字节，SECURITY 增加 15 字节。未携带 SESSION 表示 epoch 为零。`incarnation_id` "
"是传输的元数据，其存在不会安装信任，也不会替代 peer key。"
msgstr ""
"Values use little-endian integers. SESSION adds 14 frame bytes. SECURITY adds 15. Missing SESSION "
"denotes epoch zero. `incarnation_id` is carried metadata; its presence does not install trust or replace"
" the peer key."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:24
msgid "ACK 语义"
msgstr "ACK Semantics"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:26
msgid ""
"第一个 ACK 区间的 gap 必须为零，从 `largest_ack` 开始；length 为正的包数。后续区间跳过 gap 与区间边界，再描述较低包号。非法区间、下溢、未来包号使整个 ACK "
"被拒绝，在此之前不修改队列、窗口或 RTT。"
msgstr ""
"The first ACK range has gap zero and begins at `largest_ack`; length is a positive packet count. Later "
"ranges skip their gap plus the interval boundary before describing lower numbers. Invalid ranges, "
"underflow and future numbers reject the entire ACK before queue, window or RTT mutation."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:28
msgid ""
"SACK 第 `i` 位描述 `base + i`。置位确认接收方持有对应字节，低于 `base` 的记录继续等待显式确认。有效范围内的缺失位可触发快重传。全零位图只提示 `base` "
"对应记录的快重传。当前发送端最多生成八个字节的位图。Boot 即使裁剪了乱序缓存，仍可处理 transport 支持的 ACK 形式。"
msgstr ""
"SACK bit `i` describes `base + i`. A set bit confirms that the receiver owns those bytes. Records below "
"`base` await explicit acknowledgement. Gaps within the reported range can trigger fast retransmission. "
"An all-zero bitmap only hints at fast retransmission of `base`. The current sender emits at most eight "
"bitmap bytes. Boot can consume ACK forms supported by the transport even when out-of-order buffering is "
"compiled out."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:30
msgid "组合"
msgstr "Composition"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:32
msgid ""
"Network 组合或校验 DATA_TYPE 与非零 SESSION epoch 扩展。重传保留可靠 DATA 编号并重新构造帧。认证层每次尝试都从已安装的方向关联填充 SECURITY；保留 DATA "
"包不等于保留已经签名的帧。"
msgstr ""
"Network composes or validates DATA_TYPE and nonzero SESSION epoch extensions. Retransmission keeps the "
"DATA packet number and payload and recomposes the frame. Authentication fills SECURITY from the "
"installed directional association for each attempt; callers must not treat a retained DATA packet as a "
"retained signed frame."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:34
msgid "验证依据：`test/unit/wire/test_wire.cpp`。"
msgstr "Verification: `test/unit/wire/test_wire.cpp`."

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:36
msgid "保留的数据变换"
msgstr "Reserved payload transforms"

#: docs/zh/reference/protocol/v1/extensions.md:38
msgid ""
"压缩和载荷加密为保留能力。配置启用任意一项时返回 `XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`，发送请求指定非零 `compression_id` 时返回 "
"`XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`。认证标签保护完整性，其语义见[安全](security.md)。应用自行变换消息时，双方需在业务格式中约定，并在提交前检查编码后长度。"
msgstr ""
"Compression and payload encryption are reserved capabilities. Enabling either in the configuration "
"returns `XGL_ERR_INVALID_PARAM`. A send with nonzero `compression_id` returns `XGL_ERR_UNSUPPORTED`. For"
" the authentication tag, see [Security](security.md). Applications that transform messages agree on a "
"business payload format and check the encoded length before submission."
